      "value": "I've also encountered the same issue, and it still occurs in the latest live version. \n\nI've posted a report along with logs in the duplicate thread linked below. \n\nI hope this helps with the investigation and fix.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1664a-problem-that-prevents-access-to-certain-instances-believed-to-be-caused-by",
